UPDATE public.blog_articles SET direct_answer='This guide explains that hip osteoarthritis pain can involve cartilage, fluid, ligaments, muscles and the nervous system, so patterns matter. It presents structured, graded exercise as first-line, alongside Mediterranean-style eating, weight management, heat or cold, sleep hygiene and small weekly tracking. It advises seeing a GP or physiotherapist for swollen joints, weight loss, prolonged stiffness, numbness or weakness.' WHERE slug='glute-bridges-hip-osteoarthritis-guide';
